<title>USA: Warrantech signs $26 mln marketing deal.</title>
<headline>Warrantech signs $26 mln marketing deal.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warrantech Corp said Wednesday the company's wholly owned subsidiary, Warrantech Consumer Product Services Inc has signed a three-year agreement with Lechmere and HomeImage by Lechmere, wholly owned subsidiaries of Montgomery Ward, to provide marketing and administration services for Lechmere's service contract program.</p>
<p>The agreement, a statement from Warrantech said, is estimated to produce in excess of $26 million in revenues for Warrantech over the life of the contract.</p>
</text>
